[Widescreen 16:9 HUD Fix Beta]
author=Jarkkovich
description=Requires Widescreen 16:9 (nemesis2000). Rescales all 2D (HUD menus and text) by 0.75 so it is no longer stretched and anchors the gameplay HUD to the screen edges. Known issues: small gaps in the language select frame and title screen logo/background still stretched and status menu white bars extend to the right. Restart the game after toggling.
// Sprite emitter hook 0x438714 -> code cave 0xFFC00: x and width * 0.75 (f0-f2 saved at 0xFFEF0)
// Text hook 0x7AC6F0 -> code cave 0xFFD00: line x and glyph x-scale * 0.75
// Edge anchoring only in gameplay: mode 0x93C8E4 = 1 / pause menu 0xB12464 = 0 / UI or interaction 0xBA09B8 = 0 / HUD layer Z above 65060
// Y below -120 moves 60 left / Y above 0 moves 60 toward its side / middle band untouched
