[Sprint Hector x1.8]
author=Jarkkovich
description=After running for 2 seconds Hector gradually speeds up to x1.8 with the animation only 10 percent faster. Enable only one Sprint patch. Based on the Speed Patch PPF idea.
// Total speed = animation time scale 0x31A338 (up to 1.1) * extra distance factor 0xFFF10 (up to 1.636). Both reset to 1.0 when Hector stops running
// Ramp after 2.0 s x1.25 / 2.13 s x1.5 / 2.27 s x1.8
